# Repository root Trivy ignore file (intentionally EMPTY of suppressions).
#
# This file exists so every non-MySQL matrix service has a valid .trivyignore
# for the Trivy scan step. It contains NO vulnerability suppressions:
# - MySQL's vendor-image exceptions live in apps/mysql/.trivyignore and are
#   passed ONLY to the mysql matrix entry.
# - All other services scan with this file, so CRITICAL/HIGH findings remain
#   fully blocking and no MySQL-specific CVE can be inherited by other images.